#: src/berry_fix_program.c:38
msgid "Berry Program Update"
msgstr "树果程序更新"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:39
msgid "Ruby/Sapphire"
msgstr "红宝石/蓝宝石"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:40
msgid "Emerald"
msgstr "绿宝石"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:41
msgid ""
"The Berry Program on your POKéMON\n"
"Ruby/Sapphire Game Pak will be updated.\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}Press the A Button."
msgstr ""
"将更新《宝可梦 红宝石/蓝宝石》\n"
"卡带中的树果程序。\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}请按A键。"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:44
msgid ""
"Please ensure the connection of your\n"
"Game Boy Advance system matches this.\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}YES: Press the A Button.\n"
"NO: Turn off the power and try again."
msgstr ""
"请确认Game Boy Advance主机的\n"
"连接方式与图示一致。\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}是：请按A键。\n"
"否：请关闭电源后重试。"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:48
msgid ""
"Please turn on the power of POKéMON\n"
"Ruby/Sapphire while holding START and\n"
"SELECT simultaneously. Then, ensure\n"
"the picture above appears."
msgstr ""
"请同时按住START键和SELECT键，\n"
"打开《宝可梦 红宝石/蓝宝石》的\n"
"电源，然后确认上方的画面\n"
"是否出现。"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:52
msgid ""
"Transmitting. Please wait.\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}Please do not turn off the power or\n"
"unplug the Game Boy Advance Game\n"
"Link Cable."
msgstr ""
"正在传输，请稍候。\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}请不要关闭电源，\n"
"也不要拔下Game Boy Advance\n"
"连接线。"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:55
msgid ""
"Please follow the instructions on your\n"
"POKéMON Ruby/Sapphire screen."
msgstr ""
"请按照《宝可梦 红宝石/蓝宝石》\n"
"画面上的指示操作。"

#: src/berry_fix_program.c:57
msgid ""
"Transmission failure.\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}Please try again."
msgstr ""
"传输失败。\n"
"{COLOR RED}{SHADOW LIGHT_RED}请重试。"
